WEBVTT

00:00:00.813 --> 00:00:01.605
<v><b>Pia:</b></v> Who’s he?

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:05.400
<v><b>Lin:</b></v> He’s Alex. He’s in my class.

00:00:06.431 --> 00:00:07.608
<v><b>Pia:</b></v> Where’s he from?

00:00:08.351 --> 00:00:09.782
<v><b>Lin:</b></v> He’s from Mexico.

00:00:10.898 --> 00:00:12.168
<v><b>Pia:</b></v> How old is he?

00:00:12.702 --> 00:00:15.002
<v><b>Lin:</b></v> He’s 22 I think.

00:00:15.804 --> 00:00:17.466
<v><b>Pia:</b></v> He’s very good-looking!